Work the full published graduate progression, problem sets, examinations, and a substantial original special-topic study. Connect continuum and atomistic descriptions of elasticity, plasticity, strengthening, creep, fracture, and fatigue. The syllabus's required Courtney textbook is a separately accessed commercial work; the historical classroom wiki/group activities are not assumed fully available online.

